  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "18",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "REV 18"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "18",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 18:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chiyakumini yumiyi hinukumona kaŋelu mukwawu hakusuluka mwiwulu, wudi nawanta waweni, niiseki hidikutamuka nalubanji lwakulema kwindi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.18.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 18:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakubidika nezu datiyakana nankashi nindi, Babiloni muneni nahumoki, nahumoki! Nabalumuki dehi kwikala muwushakaminu wawademoni, mwakudikaŋila ademoni azonda ejima, mwakudikaŋila nawa atujila azonda ejima atiyaloŋawu antu kutama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.18.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 18:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa chananwuwu vinyu yandombu yawuvumbi windi, nyuza yejima yinaholoki. Anyanta ankanu elili nindi wuvumbi, niakwakulandulula ahanu heseki aheteli kuyuma yadiluŋishilaŋayi nachu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.18.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 18:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.18.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 18:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hinukutiya izu di kwawu kwiwulu nindi, Enu antu ami, fumenu muŋandoyu, mubuli kutiyaloŋana nanyiloŋa yindi, mubuli kutambula nindi yipupu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.18.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 18:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa nyiloŋa yindi yinatiyakani mwiwulu; Nzambi na anuki dehi mwaluwilaŋayi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.18.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 18:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwinkenu mwomwenkeleliyi akwawu, mushilenuku muyedi mwomwesekela nyidimu yindi; mulupasa mwafuŋililiyi akwawu mufuŋilenumu kayedi nawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.18.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 18:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwejima mwadilemeshelaŋayi, nimwadiluŋishilaŋayi, mufuŋilumu nikumukatisha nikuneŋa; nanochu chelaŋayi mumuchima windi nindi, Ami nashakami nimwanta wamumbanda kwami, hininfwila kwamuku, hinamba kamona kuneŋaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.18.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 18:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi chakenjila yipupu yindi mwifuku dodimu, ni kufwa, nikuneŋa, ninzala; akamushita nakesi bwi, muloŋa Yehova Nzambi wukumusompesha himukwaŋovu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.18.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 18:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.18.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 18:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anyanta ankanu aheseki aneli nindi wuvumbi, anadiluŋishi nindi, akadila makumbu nikutumpa naNsaŋu yindi, chakamonawu wishi wakesi kakumwochawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.18.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 18:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akemena hahalehi nawoma wayikatu yindi. Akela nawu, O yihuŋu! O yihuŋu! Eyi Babiloni, ŋanda yeneni, ŋanda yakola! Kusompesha kweyi kunakuwani dehi mumpinji yimu hohu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.18.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 18:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.18.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 18:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akwakulandisha aheseki hiyakumudila makumbu nikumuneŋela chikupu, muloŋa kwosi nawa wakulanda cheŋi yuma yawuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.18.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 18:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yuma yawuru, nisiliva, nitumalola twalema wuseya, nimperola; nimahina amawahi atooka niawusombu niashikima niachinana; ninyitondu yanunka chachiwahi yejima, niyuma yakutuŋa nambiŋa yanjamba yejima, niyuma yakutuŋa nanyitondu yalema wuseya yejima, niwuneŋu, niyikuŋu, nimalola amawahi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.18.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 18:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nisinamoni niyuma yanunka chachiwahi, niinsensi, nimalasha, nilibona, nivinyu, nimanji, niwuŋa walembuluka, nitidiku, ni aŋombi, nianyikoku, niatuwalu namakálu, nianduŋu, nimawumi awantu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.18.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 18:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yuma yiwafwilili mumuchima weyi yinakufumi dehi, yuma yatowala yejima, niyuma yakuvwala yalema, yinakukisikili dehi, antu hiyamba kayimona nawa cheŋi nihantuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.18.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 18:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akwakulandisha nakulandulula yumiyi, aheteleli kudi yena, akemena hahalehi nawoma wayikatu yindi, nakudila makumbu nakuneŋa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.18.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 18:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nakwila nawu, O yihuŋu! O yihuŋu! ŋanda yeneni wavweli mahina amawahi atooka niawusombu niachinana. Wadileŋaleŋeli yuma yawuru nitumalola twalema wuseya, nimperola! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.18.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 18:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa mumpinji yimu hohu maheta asweja chi kuma hochu anakisiki dehi ji-i. Niakwakuyula maatu niantu ejima akwendelamu kwejima kwakukeŋa kuyawu, niakwakwendesha maatu, niantu ejima ahandilaŋa nyidimu yahakaluŋalwiji, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.18.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 18:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hiyakwimena hahalehi nakukaloka nyiteti, chakumonawu wishi wakesi kakumwochawu, nawu, ŋandanyi yidi neyi ŋandiyi yeneni? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.18.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 18:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiyakudisukwila lunkuŋu hanyitu yawu, hiyakukaloka nyiteti nikudila makumbu, nikuneŋa nawu, O yihuŋu! O yihuŋu! ŋanda yeneni, mwadiheteshelaŋawu antu ejima adiŋi namaatu hakaluŋalwiji nayuma yindi yasweja kulema wuseya! Muloŋa mumpinji yimu hohu anamubalumuni kwikala chihembi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.18.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 18:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enu mawulu, ninenu akwakujila, ninenu apostolu, ninenu atuprofwetu, muzaŋalelenu; muloŋa Nzambi namusompeshi dehi, nayitendi dehi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.18.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 18:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.18.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 18:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaŋelu waŋovu wumu hakunyamuna ilola didi neyi ilola deneni dakuhala, ilolodu hakudinatila mukaluŋalwiji nindi, Dichi chakanatilawu Babiloni, ŋanda yeneni, naŋovu heseki; hiyamba kayimona nawa cheŋi nihantuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.18.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 18:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuvuma kwatudada niyisanji nimahululu nimpùŋa hikwamba katiyakana nawa cheŋi mudeyi hela ifuku dimuku. Mudeyi himwamba kamwekana nawa cheŋi mukwawukalawenu hiwukalawenuku; hela lushindu lwakutwa mwiyanda hilwamba katiyakana nawa cheŋi mudeyi hela ifuku dimuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.18.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 18:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hela chejeji chenoŋu hichamba katoŋeka nawa cheŋi mudeyi nichantuku. Hela izu dansumbuli hela dansumbuki hidamba katiyakana cheŋi mudeyi hela ifuku dimuku. Muloŋa antu eyi, akwakulandisha nakulandulula, adiŋi atulamba ahanu heseki; muloŋa wadimbili nyuza yejima nakupanda kweyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.18.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 18:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mudi yena awenumu mashi awatuprofwetu niawakwakujila ni awantu ejima ajahiluwu hanu hamaseki.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.18.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
